\":\"AccumulatorDerivative\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":6709,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":113,\"start\":6688},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":6927,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":113,\"start\":6679}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"AreaOutput\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":5457,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":86,\"start\":5447},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":5655,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":86,\"start\":5438}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"ChamberDerivative\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":6256,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":105,\"start\":6239},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":6666,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":105,\"start\":6230}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"CommandOutput\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":5300,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":83,\"start\":5287},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":5425,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":83,\"start\":5278}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"ExposureDerivative\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":7041,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":120,\"start\":7023},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":7153,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":120,\"start\":7014}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"OrificeOutput\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":5690,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":91,\"start\":5677},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":5852,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":91,\"start\":5668}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"StrokeDerivative\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":5959,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":97,\"start\":5943},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":6037,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":97,\"start\":5934}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"CalculationDefinition\",\"name\":\"VelocityDerivative\",\"name_span\":{\"col\":21,\"end\":6077,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":100,\"start\":6059},\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":12,\"end\":6179,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":100,\"start\":6050}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Documentation\",\"name\":null,\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"props\":{\"body\":\"Reciprocating-pump hybrid dynamics.\\n     *\\n     * Continuous states (all `out attribute`, integrated by the SSR pattern):\\n     *   stroke        centered actuator position; physical position x = stroke + 0.5 in [0,1]\\n     *   strokeRate    actuator velocity (dx/dt)\\n     *   chamberPressure     p_c, chamber pressure                    (pressure)\\n     *   accumulatorPressure p_a, downstream/accumulator pressure     (pressure)\\n     *   exposure      z, integral of sustained over-pressure         (pressure*time)\\n     *\\n     * Actuator: an undamped harmonic oscillator about the mid-stroke, so it\\n     * self-sustains a phase-normalized cosine position with NO manual seed:\\n     *   stroke''   = -omega^2 * stroke        =>   x(t) = 0.5*(1 - cos(omega t))\\n     * released from stroke = -0.5, strokeRate = 0. Energy is conserved, so the\\n     * unforced actuator neither grows nor decays (bounded-drift invariant).\\n     *\\n     * Hydraulics (first principles; see README for the full derivation):\\n     *   q_src   = pistonArea * max(0, strokeRate)          delivery-stroke inflow\\n     *   u       = clamp(dP / dpRef, 0, 1)                  normalized valve command\\n     *   A_eff   = interpolate(opening|closing branch, u)   sampled check-valve area\\n     *   q_out   = Cq * A_eff * sqrt(max(dP, epsRoot))      regularized orifice outflow\\n     *   q_leak  = kLeak * chamberPressure                  linear chamber leak\\n     *   q_rest  = restrictionConductance * sqrt(max(accumulatorPressure, epsRoot))\\n     *   p_c'    = Kc * (q_src - q_out - q_leak)\\n     *   p_a'    = Ka * (q_out - q_rest)\\n     *   z'      = max(0, chamberPressure - pWarning)       exposure accumulation\\n     *\\n     * The check valve is forward-only: dP = p_c - p_a is clamped by max(dP, epsRoot)\\n     * so the orifice never draws fluid backwards, and epsRoot regularizes the\\n     * square root's otherwise-infinite slope at dP = 0 (bounded slope 1/(2*sqrt(epsRoot))).\\n     * The branch is chosen by the sign of strokeRate: rising command (advancing\\n     * stroke, strokeRate >= 0) uses the opening branch, falling command uses the\\n     * closing branch. strokeRate >= 0 is the explicit initial branch (strokeRate\\n     * starts at 0).\"},\"spans\":[{\"col\":4,\"end\":2239,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":2,\"start\":27}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":20,\"end\":5640,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":88,\"start\":5523}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":23,\"end\":5541,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":88,\"start\":5526}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":23,\"end\":6587,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":110,\"start\":6556}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":23,\"end\":6650,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":110,\"start\":6556}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"<UUID>\",\"spans\":[{\"col\":23,\"end\":6911,\"file\":\"<FILE>\",\"line\":115,\"start\":6816}]},{\"id\":\"<UUID>\",\"kind\":\"Feature\",\"name\":\"x\",\"owner\":\"<UUID>\",\"owning_membership\":\"